# ...except the frontend production build. The cPanel host can't run Vite
# (CloudLinux's npm redirects installs into the app venv, so devDependencies
# never land in frontend/), so dist/ is built locally with
# VITE_BASE_PATH=/audit and deployed by `git pull` on the server.
!frontend/dist/
